OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain for the
OL,6,Fevening, turning more persistent late
OL,7,Fevening, then clearing towards dawn,
OL,8,Fto leave only a few light showers in
OL,9,Fthe west. Brisk southerly winds easing
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA cloudy start in the east.
OL,13,FOtherwise a day of showers mixed with
OL,14,Fbrighter spells, with the bulk of the
OL,15,Fshowers confined west of the A9.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
